cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper below."
title: "Code for \"On Some Structural Properties of Graphs with Non-Negative Resistance Curvature\""
abstract: >-
  Code used to check the RN/RP status, sprawling property, and toughness of
  the graphs discussed in the accompanying paper, including an exact
  certifier for resistance nonnegativity built on a linear program over the
  spanning tree polytope.
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/Gyagr7/Effective-Resistance-Curvature-Graph-Properties"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
